  "description_short": "Specialty coffee and all-day breakfast on Main Street with a relaxed, creative vibe.",
  "description_long": "Tucked into a charming spot on Plettenberg Bay's Main Street, Eleven Coffee Shop offers more than just excellent coffee — though their carefully crafted espresso drinks and filter brews are reason enough to visit. The menu covers all-day breakfast favourites, fresh sandwiches, salads, and baked goods that pair perfectly with their specialty beans. The atmosphere strikes a balance between laid-back and creative, making it equally suited for a quick morning cappuccino or a leisurely brunch with friends.\n\nThe space feels welcoming and unpretentious, with indoor seating and a casual energy that reflects Plett's easygoing character. It's become a local favourite for good reason — quality ingredients, friendly service, and a genuine appreciation for proper coffee. Whether you're starting your day before exploring the Garden Route or taking a midday break from the beach, Eleven delivers consistently good food and drinks in a relaxed setting that feels authentically Plettenberg Bay.",
